{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他先被一阵刺骨的惊惧攫住，熟悉的亲近像日常细节般浮现，却带着失落。\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"from\": [\"S06\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B5\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M22\", \"M24\", \"M25\", \"M30\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"S06让他知道，亲近虽能留作安慰，却不能让过去重新成为眼前。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S06\"],\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M4\", \"M6\", \"M12\", \"M15\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他不愿只把亲近留作心里的安慰，开始急切地想让它再次发生。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S04\", \"S06\"],\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M8\", \"M17\", \"M18\", \"M21\", \"M26\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"S04已让他发现，重新站稳只能承认在意，不能让轻快与亲近继续；承认在意仍不足以满足他。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S04\"],\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M4\", \"M10\", \"M15\", \"M17\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"急切没有变成办法，紧张反而一层层积起，最后停在屏息般的等待里。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S05\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B3\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M20\", \"M23\", \"M28\", \"M32\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"S05里，他已试过用力延续轻快与亲近，结果只耗尽力气；这次想争取，却无从着力。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S05\"],\n      \"explains\": [],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M5\", \"M6\", \"M19\", \"M27\", \"M32\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"new\": [\n    \"他发现，珍惜亲近带来的安慰，不等于甘心它不再继续；急切最终只剩紧绷的等待。\"\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B2\",\n      \"why\": \"这条听感指出舞蹈性材料与前段的反差，但仅凭材料转向，无法确定他此刻产生了什么具体念头；不能把音乐变化直接写成心理触发。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B4\",\n      \"why\": \"这是对音乐材料身份的另一种辨认，不足以推出他正在重新建立秩序或找回旧日自我。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "aacd0e84-b9f0-4d6a-9022-fbf07f15ddb4", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T002838015325Z", "elapsed_seconds": 185.891, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T00:31:43.920848+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "4c7cdfc3ac668e64f85ff61cfe256d8b6dd4feb3f810e3adb0f5f26412bde6f0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T002838015325Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "78c0534c951749e0d2d0c89a66b0065128c596ad33cc973e7695efd077d1884b"}}}
